merged since v0.17.0: the ribbon polish (#767), capitalised tab titles and
the removed status-bar tail. Regenerated once at the cut, as AGENTS.md
"Pixel snapshots are release-lane" says. The maintainer accepted them for
this cut without the usual manual look at the diff images (2026-11-12);
the gpu_render docs snapshot was unchanged.

